--- s3orig/firmware/gm/PlaybackProgramSnapshot.h	2026-10-21 03:52:34.000000000 +0000
+++ s3src/firmware/gm/PlaybackProgramSnapshot.h	2026-10-21 03:55:28.808216481 +0000
